  "question": {
    "text": "The half life period of a radioactive element <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> is same as the mean life time of another radioactive element <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>.</mo></math> Initially they have the same number of atoms. Then:",
